---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: states
  size: 1
  alias: stateEntry
permalink: "/{{ stateEntry.stateSlug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Notary open late in {{ stateEntry.stateName }} · LateNotary"
  description: "Notary open late in {{ stateEntry.stateName }}. City pages list a Sunday notary and a mobile notary near me, with evening and weekend hours from public sources."
---
<article class="city-page">
  <header class="page-hero wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">State index</p>
    <h1>Notary open late in {{ stateEntry.stateName }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">City pages for a Sunday notary or a mobile notary near me in {{ stateEntry.stateName }}. Each listing uses hours and fees copied from a public source, with the date it was last checked.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="state-cities-heading">
    <h2 id="state-cities-heading">Cities</h2>
    <ul class="state-city-list">
      {% for city in stateEntry.cities %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ city | cityPath }}">Notary open late in {{ city.city }}, {{ city.state }}</a>
        <p class="small muted">Sunday notary and mobile notary near me{% if city.focus %} · {{ city.focus }} focus{% endif %} · {{ city.listings | length }} listings · Updated {{ city.lastUpdated | displayDate }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap tonight">
    <h2>After hours and weekends</h2>
    <p><a href="/guides/notarize-after-hours-or-weekend/">How to get a document notarized after hours or on a weekend</a></p>
  </section>
</article>
